{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1254402-the-beast-societies","id":1254402,"title":"The beast societies","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-09-14T22:36:27-07:00","id":1254402,"title":"The beast societies","content":"Will the atheaneum, guardians, empusae, and the apex predator beasts get fuller write ups at some point? As of the beast player guide they are more to further flesh out your own beast and give story hooks, without added mechanical effects","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-15T00:28:43-07:00","id":1254413,"title":"","content":"<b>Beast</b>'s <i>Athenaeum of the Dark Mother</i> could easily use mechanics for <b>Mage</b>'s 2E Athenea of Mysterium - they are very similar concepts. I even have theory that <b>Beast</b>'s one is nightmare representation of <b>Mage</b>'s one, Dark Dream for Begotten to Bright Dream of Awakened. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> \u200b<i>Empusae</i>, then, are in reality <b>really</b> dedicated Obcasus Rites Initiates, seeking <b>real</b> Communion with Dark Mother. Just pour all XP in Rites and run character in that she looks for signs from Dark Mother <i>everywhere</i> - and you have Empusae. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <i>Guardian Beasts</i> sounds as those that look out to <b><i>not see</i></b> information of Dark Mother. They do not seek Communion, rather early warning system of Mothers doing. <b>I would made special Merit tree based on their <i>Warning</i> Condition - antagonistic to Mother variant of <i>Communion</i> - that get's them bonuses to seeing dangers of Mother and rest of Astral. </b>That sounds fitting. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <i>Dominae</i> are simply Begotten striking to be always local Apex. As they (quoting) 'invariably seek a position of ultimate authority and their every interaction with their kin is part of the complex maneuvering necessary to reach a place of absolute social dominance within the brood' - that sound a lot like Venture vampires, Silver Ladder or Seers of Throne mages or Spring Courtiers changeling. Using some of Merits mechanics for those should be enough. Or just simply get <i>Dominae </i>some Style Merit based on Social Maneuvering of others. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> May look into those things in coming weeks, as looks as interesting concepts to homebrew.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 09-15-2018, 03:49 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-15T06:51:36-07:00","id":1254488,"title":"","conte